  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After class, our "
        },
        {
          "text": "group",
          "wordIds": [
            "group"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gathers around a library table to work on an English "
        },
        {
          "text": "project",
          "wordIds": [
            "project"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "下課後，我們小組圍坐在圖書館的桌子旁，一起進行英語專案作業。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin opens his notebook and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What should we do first?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-should-we-do-first"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Kevin 打開筆記本問道：「我們應該先做什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia shares a creative "
        },
        {
          "text": "idea",
          "wordIds": [
            "idea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " about world festivals."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 分享了一個關於世界節慶的創意點子。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo agrees and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "That's a great ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-a-great-idea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "idea",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-a-great-idea"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "idea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-a-great-idea"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 表示贊同並說：「那是個好主意。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Next, we divide each "
        },
        {
          "text": "task",
          "wordIds": [
            "task"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and Mia offers to do the research."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著，我們分配各項任務，Mia 主動負責資料搜尋。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I can make the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-can-make-the-poster"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "poster",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-can-make-the-poster"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "poster"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-can-make-the-poster"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 微笑著說：「我可以做海報。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Before packing up, Kevin says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's meet on ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-meet-on-friday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Friday",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-meet-on-friday"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "friday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-meet-on-friday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在收拾書包前，Kevin 說：「我們星期五見面吧。」"
    }
  ],
